    "summary": "Indigo stitch resist-dyed cotton cloth; skirt.  Composed of six wide strips in plain weave hand sewn together. Strips have alternating groups of black- and indigo-dyed warp threads in machine-spun cotton. The indigo warp threads are decorated with alternating triple dot and linear patterns throughout. Plain indigo and black warp striped bands at either end except for dotted semi-circles at edge of each strip; unworked warp thread fringes.",
